// XYPlot overlaid image. Name of object = id of an existing XYPlot (in any DisplayGroup) to show.
  The XYPlot with its Curve/DynCurve/DynPoint items is configured as usual in a DisplayGroup;
  this item only references it. An unknown id is reported and the item is skipped.
  ImageXYPlot:   ImageXYPlotName
            X1=  -1
            Y1=  -1
            X2=  -1
            Y2=  -1
